    const guidance = "## Swarm Autogen\nSwarm autogenerated skills are separate from Pi's native skills. Before complex work, use Skill to invoke a relevant reusable skill, or use SkillManage to list/view/review/patch skills. Prefer patching an existing skill or adding a support file; a no-mutation review is valid. Do not create a new skill unless no existing skill fits.";
